1
00:00:07,799 --> 00:00:11,800
The living room door clicks.

2
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:16,199
I stand in the dark.

3
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:21,399
His anger stays downstairs.

4
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:26,199
Cold shadows leave a mark.

5
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:31,000
My hand upon the wood.

6
00:00:31,399 --> 00:00:35,799
I hear your quiet plea.

7
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:40,500
Red keys weep in the night.

8
00:00:40,799 --> 00:00:45,200
Your secret reaches me.

9
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,200
No hymns of stone and fear.

10
00:00:50,799 --> 00:00:55,000
No churchly, rigid line.

11
00:00:55,399 --> 00:00:59,399
I taught those hands to play.

12
00:00:59,799 --> 00:01:04,500
That beating heart is mine.

13
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:09,500
The floorboards gently hum.

14
00:01:09,799 --> 00:01:14,000
With love you had to hide.

15
00:01:14,599 --> 00:01:18,799
I feel the bitter cost.

16
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:23,500
Of silence on his side.

17
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:28,500
A mother on the stairs.

18
00:01:28,799 --> 00:01:33,000
Alone beneath your pain.

19
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:37,500
His pride will never bend.

20
00:01:37,799 --> 00:01:42,500
You bleed in winter rain.

21
00:01:42,799 --> 00:01:47,500
Sing out your lonely song.

22
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:52,500
Fill up the empty room.

23
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:56,799
I know the boy you are.

24
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:01,799
Before the morning gloom.

25
00:02:02,599 --> 00:02:06,500
I hear you, Paul...

26
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:11,800
I hear your heart...